    "updated_at": "2023-07-07T23:06:15Z",
    "body": "This PR (as currently written) is purely to align the spec text w/ Chromium behavior. That doesn't mean we should merge it though! Notably:\r\n\r\n* Chromium doesn't error on read. Should it?\r\n* `document.cookie` prevents writes if the document is \"cookie-averse\". Alignment might be nice?\r\n* Needs tests!\r\n",
