    "body": "I looked briefly at tests just to capture Chrome's behavior - given the `[SecureContext]` requirement for the API I'm drawing a blank on exercising the \"not potentially trustworthy\" check from WPT given https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-secure-contexts/#is-origin-trustworthy .\r\n\r\nA manual test for `file:` is doable. Ideas welcome.",
